# demo-output/: the transcript is worth keeping as evidence; the parts it builds
# and the raw call log are regenerated by scripts/demo_build.py.
demo-output/*.SLDPRT
demo-output/demo-log.json
demo-output/audit.jsonl

# reference/swapi-docs/: Dassault's SOLIDWORKS API Help, vendored for offline use.
# Not committed for two reasons. It is marked "for personal/educational use only" and
# the upstream repository carries no license, so redistributing it here would be
# republishing someone else's copyrighted documentation. And it is a fetched
# dependency rather than source: scripts/fetch_api_docs.py pins release v3.12.1 and
# --check verifies the vendored prose still matches the installed type library.
reference/swapi-docs/
